  <h1>Tabletop RPGs</h1>
  <p class="lede">Two project types are made for tabletop roleplaying games: <strong>Tabletop Adventure</strong> for a one-shot or a module, and <strong>Tabletop Campaign</strong> for a game you run week after week. They work with any game; 5E-compatible sheets are included for those who want them.</p>

